{"unit_id":"star-Cosmo__dsh-model-tidy#card-zh","repo":"star-Cosmo/dsh-model-tidy","commit":"f2858077a6e43253f7c641a813ab3ba37709c066","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-tidy 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型列表整理插件。它在设置页加入模型整理界面，并包装模型目录读取逻辑，让你按渠道隐藏或恢复模型、为模型和渠道设置易识别的备注名，还能分别调整模型及渠道顺序。界面支持按模型、渠道或备注搜索，并可批量隐藏或显示某渠道的模型；重命名时会保留名称中的厂商计费后缀。适合模型来源较多、希望精简选择器并固定常用顺序的用户。插件把这些选择保存在自己的设置项中，不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:276-383","lib/client.js:1277-1309","lib/client.js:1410-1595","lib/client.js:1742-1793"]}
{"unit_id":"star-Cosmo__dsh-model-tidy#card-en","repo":"star-Cosmo/dsh-model-tidy","commit":"f2858077a6e43253f7c641a813ab3ba37709c066","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-tidy is a DSH web plugin for organizing the model selector. Its settings page hides or restores models, renames models and providers, and reorders both lists. Search by model, provider, or alias; bulk hide or show a provider's models. Renames retain billing suffixes. No API key needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:276-383","lib/client.js:1277-1309","lib/client.js:1410-1595","lib/client.js:1742-1793"]}
