{"unit_id":"star-Cosmo__dsh-model-tidy#feature-1","repo":"star-Cosmo/dsh-model-tidy","commit":"f2858077a6e43253f7c641a813ab3ba37709c066","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-tidy 的功能「按渠道管理可见性」：在设置页对单个模型切换显示状态，也可批量隐藏或显示某渠道的模型。界面写入插件设置，宿主侧按渠道和模型 id 过滤目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:962-1024","lib/index.js:289-319"]}
